      "revision": 1301302933,
      "text": "Ribes viburnifolium, is an uncommon North American species in the gooseberry family. It is known by the common names Catalina currant, Santa Catalina Island currant, island gooseberry and evergreen currant."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Ribes viburnifolium",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ribes_viburnifolium",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29984884,
      "text": "Ribes viburnifolium, adalah spesies tumbuhan langka dari Amerika Utara dalam suku gooseberry. Spesies ini dikenal dengan nama umum Catalina currant, Santa Catalina Island currant, island gooseberry dan evergreen currant."
    }
  },
